# Phase 166.1: the weather, in the app (the owner's rule, 2026-11-21: the
# app is the instrument, Dash a remote). The weather window opens, and its
# REFRESH asks the app's own weather source for a new reading, the same
# refresh Dash's button sends.

name    Weather: the app's own window and its refresh
timeout 90

rig     WeatherSource=internal

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Weather
wait   3
press  WEATHER:SHOW
press  WEATHER:REFRESH
expect 10  [WX] refresh from the app
shot   weather
